When you kill a dragon (maybe just a specific colour) you have a small
chance of obtaining dragon's teeth. Maybe then you would have to enchant
or bless them. Now when planted you would otain a loyal soldier for
each dragon tooth.

If you are invisible and come across a barracks you could throw a
projectile into the room and create a conflict among the soldiers.


